+/* ------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ * DS4-TP-gfx1151 (patch 10): K-sliced Q8_0 matmul.
+ *
+ * Needed by ds4_gpu_attention_output_q8_tp_tensor, which fires at layer 0 of
+ * the first token under TP=2. Upstream ships it as a silent `return 0` stub in
